Experiment:

 Draw a natural number r from the intervall [0,l-1] and
 increment a counter s when r < l div 2 is satisfied.
 Repeat this step n times and calculate the ratio s/n.

 Expected ratio:        5.0000000000000000E-001

    Input size n            Observed ratio s/n
              16       8.1250000000000000E-001
              32       6.5625000000000000E-001
              64       7.9687500000000000E-001
             128       6.7187500000000000E-001
             256       6.6406250000000000E-001
             512       6.9335937500000000E-001
            1024       6.6601562500000000E-001
            2048       6.6357421875000000E-001
            4096       6.7163085937500000E-001
            8192       6.5441894531250000E-001
           16384       6.7169189453125000E-001
           32768       6.6424560546875000E-001
           65536       6.6812133789062500E-001
          131072       6.6744995117187500E-001
